INSERT INTO `wp_cmplz_cookiebanners` VALUES (1,'Cookie',569,1,'bottom-right','slider','site','0','1','G├®rer les pr├®f├®rences','show-everywhere','a:2:{s:4:\"text\";s:24:\"G├®rer les pr├®f├®rences\";s:4:\"show\";i:1;}','a:2:{s:4:\"text\";s:7:\"Refuser\";s:4:\"show\";i:1;}','Sauvegarder les pr├®f├®rences','View preferences','Fonctionnel','a:2:{s:4:\"text\";s:9:\"Marketing\";s:4:\"show\";i:1;}','a:2:{s:4:\"text\";s:12:\"Statistiques\";s:4:\"show\";i:1;}','a:2:{s:4:\"text\";s:13:\"Pr├®f├®rences\";s:4:\"show\";i:1;}','Accepter','<p>Pour vous offrir la meilleure exp├®rience possible, nous utilisons des technologies telles que les cookies pour stocker et/ou acc├®der aux informations de lÔÇÖappareil. Le consentement ├á ces technologies nous permettra de traiter des donn├®es telles que le comportement de navigation ou les identifiants uniques sur ce site. Le refus ou le retrait du consentement peut avoir un impact n├®gatif sur certaines fonctionnalit├®s et caract├®ristiques.</p>','save-preferences',0,526,0,0,0,'10','a:2:{s:4:\"text\";s:6:\"Accept\";s:4:\"show\";i:1;}','To provide the best experiences, we use technologies like cookies to store and/or access device information. Consenting to these technologies will allow us to process data such as browsing behavior or unique IDs on this site. Not consenting or withdrawing consent, may adversely affect certain features and functions.','0','/* Container */\n.cmplz-cookiebanner{}\n\n/* Logo */\n.cmplz-cookiebanner .cmplz-logo{}\n/* Title */\n.cmplz-cookiebanner .cmplz-title{}\n/* Close icon */\n.cmplz-cookiebanner .cmplz-close{}\n\n/* Message */\n.cmplz-cookiebanner .cmplz-message{}\n\n /* All buttons */\n.cmplz-buttons .cmplz-btn{}\n/* Accept button */\n.cmplz-btn .cmplz-accept{} \n /* Deny button */\n.cmplz-btn .cmplz-deny{}\n /* Save preferences button */\n.cmplz-btn .cmplz-deny{}\n /* View preferences button */\n.cmplz-btn .cmplz-deny{}\n\n /* Document hyperlinks */\n.cmplz-links .cmplz-documents{}\n\n /* Categories */\n.cmplz-cookiebanner .cmplz-category{}\n.cmplz-cookiebanner .cmplz-category-title{} \n\n/* Manage consent tab */\n#cmplz-manage-consent .cmplz-manage-consent{} \n\n/* Soft cookie wall */\n.cmplz-soft-cookiewall{}\n\n/* Placeholder button - Per category */\n.cmplz-blocked-content-container .cmplz-blocked-content-notice{}\n\n/* Placeholder button & message - Per service */\n.cmplz-blocked-content-container .cmplz-blocked-content-notice,\n.cmplz-blocked-content-notice{}\nbutton.cmplz-accept-service{}\n\n/* Styles for the AMP notice */\n#cmplz-consent-ui, #cmplz-post-consent-ui {}\n/* Message */\n#cmplz-consent-ui .cmplz-consent-message {}\n/* Buttons */\n#cmplz-consent-ui button, #cmplz-post-consent-ui button {}','a:0:{}','a:2:{s:4:\"text\";s:327:\"Le stockage ou lÔÇÖacc├¿s technique est strictement n├®cessaire dans la finalit├® l├®gitime de permettre lÔÇÖutilisation dÔÇÖun service sp├®cifique explicitement demand├® par lÔÇÖabonn├® ou lÔÇÖutilisateur, ou dans le seul but dÔÇÖeffectuer la transmission dÔÇÖune communication sur un r├®seau de communications ├®lectroniques.\";s:4:\"show\";i:1;}','a:2:{s:4:\"text\";s:82:\"The technical storage or access that is used exclusively for statistical purposes.\";s:4:\"show\";i:1;}','a:2:{s:4:\"text\";s:431:\"Le stockage ou lÔÇÖacc├¿s technique qui est utilis├® exclusivement ├á des fins statistiques anonymes. En lÔÇÖabsence dÔÇÖune assignation ├á compara├«tre, dÔÇÖune conformit├® volontaire de la part de votre fournisseur dÔÇÖacc├¿s ├á Internet ou dÔÇÖenregistrements suppl├®mentaires provenant dÔÇÖun tiers, les informations stock├®es ou extraites ├á cette seule fin ne peuvent g├®n├®ralement pas ├¬tre utilis├®es pour vous identifier.\";s:4:\"show\";i:1;}','a:2:{s:4:\"text\";s:171:\"Le stockage ou lÔÇÖacc├¿s technique est n├®cessaire dans la finalit├® l├®gitime de stocker des pr├®f├®rences qui ne sont pas demand├®es par lÔÇÖabonn├® ou lÔÇÖutilisateur.\";s:4:\"show\";i:1;}','a:2:{s:4:\"text\";s:181:\"The technical storage or access is required to create user profiles to send advertising, or to track the user on a website or across several websites for similar marketing purposes.\";s:4:\"show\";i:1;}','a:2:{s:5:\"color\";s:7:\"#ffffff\";s:6:\"border\";s:7:\"#f2f2f2\";}','a:2:{s:5:\"color\";s:7:\"#222222\";s:9:\"hyperlink\";s:7:\"#1E73BE\";}','a:3:{s:10:\"background\";s:7:\"#1e73be\";s:6:\"bullet\";s:7:\"#ffffff\";s:8:\"inactive\";s:7:\"#F56E28\";}','a:5:{s:3:\"top\";i:12;s:5:\"right\";i:12;s:6:\"bottom\";i:12;s:4:\"left\";i:12;s:4:\"type\";s:2:\"px\";}','a:4:{s:3:\"top\";i:0;s:5:\"right\";i:0;s:6:\"bottom\";i:0;s:4:\"left\";i:0;}','12','a:3:{s:10:\"background\";s:7:\"#1E73BE\";s:6:\"border\";s:7:\"#1E73BE\";s:4:\"text\";s:7:\"#ffffff\";}','a:3:{s:10:\"background\";s:7:\"#f9f9f9\";s:6:\"border\";s:7:\"#f2f2f2\";s:4:\"text\";s:7:\"#222222\";}','a:3:{s:10:\"background\";s:7:\"#f9f9f9\";s:6:\"border\";s:7:\"#f2f2f2\";s:4:\"text\";s:7:\"#333333\";}','a:5:{s:3:\"top\";i:6;s:5:\"right\";i:6;s:6:\"bottom\";i:6;s:4:\"left\";i:6;s:4:\"type\";s:2:\"px\";}','none',1,0,0,1,1);
