95eb85084ec53a646c5775fb147104d7554e7a949d5ad3?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/beranyer/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">beranyer</a> on <span class=\"review-date\">June 6, 2025</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Le agradezco los felicito a sido muy buen├¡sima herramienta</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Kept My Site Safe All Month</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				By <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/pukyu1/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/5b67eb39e60ba7e8955e9ac1e9e44c76e0f6a3acb293672e3a84eafbb0367d7b?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/5b67eb39e60ba7e8955e9ac1e9e44c76e0f6a3acb293672e3a84eafbb0367d7b?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/pukyu1/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">htahta <small>(pukyu1)</small></a> on <span class=\"review-date\">May 31, 2025</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Kept my site secure for a month security now, awesome! Really helpful secure plugin!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">From hero to zero!!</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"1 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"1\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				By <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/markonovak/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/cda578f5fb3c37baeed29a425148fd8cd5eef68df5dffc17a44c17dffcf7e6e2?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/cda578f5fb3c37baeed29a425148fd8cd5eef68df5dffc17a44c17dffcf7e6e2?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/markonovak/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">MarkoNovak</a> on <span class=\"review-date\">May 29, 2025</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You see, this was once Really Simple SSL! You installed it and could forget about you Let┬┤s Encrypt certificate, it did everything for you! Today, it does everything but taking care of SSL certificates! It sells you a bunch of crap nobody on the planet needs on a WordPress site, and the best part, it can\'t even detect an expired certificate anymore where even automatically renew anything! So, there you are, within expiring certificate warning near entering your site, and you go to once, indeed really simple SSL plugin, and the damn thing not only does not know that the site certificate is expired!?? It offers no way to renew the last anymore. Greed is a bitch! Eventually, it eats someone away...</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n\";}s:13:\"download_link\";s:66:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/really-simple-ssl.9.4.0.zip\";s:14:\"upgrade_notice\";a:1:{s:0:\"\";s:328:\"<p>On settings page load, the .htaccess file is no rewritten. If you have made .htaccess customizations to the RSSSL block and have not blocked the plugin from editing it, do so before upgrading.\nAlways back up before any upgrade. Especially .htaccess, wp-config.php and the plugin folder. This way you can easily roll back.</p>\";}s:11:\"screenshots\";a:5:{i:1;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:70:\"https://ps.w.org/really-simple-ssl/assets/screenshot-1.png?rev=3153900\";s:7:\"caption\";s:72:\"The Really Simple Security Dashboard provides a quick security overview.\";}i:2;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:70:\"https://ps.w.org/really-simple-ssl/assets/screenshot-2.png?rev=3153900\";s:7:\"caption\";s:36:\"Enable or enforce 2FA per user role.\";}i:3;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:70:\"https://ps.w.org/really-simple-ssl/assets/screenshot-3.png?rev=3153900\";s:7:\"caption\";s:56:\"Stay ahead of plugin, theme and WP core vulnerabilities.\";}i:4;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:70:\"https://ps.w.org/really-simple-ssl/assets/screenshot-4.png?rev=3153900\";s:7:\"caption\";s:60:\"Harden your siteÔÇÖs security with Basic Hardening features.\";}i:5;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:70:\"https://ps.w.org/really-simple-ssl/assets/screenshot-5.png?rev=3153900\";s:7:\"caption\";s:58:\"1-minute configuration with the short security onboarding.\";}}s:4:\"tags\";a:5:{s:3:\"2fa\";s:3:\"2FA\";s:8:\"security\";s:8:\"security\";s:3:\"ssl\";s:3:\"ssl\";s:10:\"two-factor\";s:10:\"two factor\";s:15:\"vulnerabilities\";s:15:\"vulnerabilities\";}s:8:\"versions\";a:14:{s:5:\"9.1.1\";s:66:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/really-simple-ssl.9.1.1.zip\";s:7:\"9.1.1.1\";s:68:\"https://downloads